<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto/0.2.0> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Nader Jelassi"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-04-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Quang-Duy Nguyen"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Example Tyre Ontology (ETO) is an exemplar ontology for the tyre sector. It specialises the EU DPP Core Ontology (CORE), whose terms it references by their IRIs."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-04-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-10-22"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Example Tyre Ontology (ETO)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "eto" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto#" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Developed against the CIRPASS-2 CORE ontology as of 12 October 2026: core v2.0.7, P_DPP v2.1.0, IDENT v1.2.0, CON v2.2.0, ACTOR v2.1.3, EVENT v1.0.0, SOC v2.0.0. Checked against the CORE of 21 October 2026: core v2.1.0, P_DPP v2.2.0, IDENT v1.2.0, CON v2.4.0, ACTOR v2.2.0, EVENT v1.0.0, SOC v2.2.0. The CORE is referenced by IRI, without owl:imports: load the CORE files together with this file for reasoning or validation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Example Tyre Ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/eto> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "Version 0.2.0 DRAFT"@en .
